    "original": "Does not affect damage from mental attacks or status effects.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  {
    "ID": 1007412413,
    "key": "0c1ea31fc61bcf4c6bddf8f65835dafba160179fca356ce5352c2b1fdc10e489",
    "original": "Does not stack with other free swap skills.",
